    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1777">

                <pb facs="1294" n="1178" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg1178"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 419.11D29/102.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Price to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-08-13">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 13, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your telegram of August 7. In addition to proposal contained in my telegram of
                    April 26, Minister for Foreign Affairs by formal note agrees to let us select as
                    arbitrator the Minister of Netherlands to the United States, who is also
                    accredited to this Government, or any one of the Ambassadors from Argentina,
                    Brazil, and Chile to the United States.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Price.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
